      "abstained": 0,
      "anchor_quote": "When building around it, we're not concerned about accuracy, critical strike chance and whether we hit the target with our projectile — but rather about the pool of caustic ground it leaves on impact with the floor.",
      "conf": 0.92,
      "created_date": "2026-07-18",
      "extraction_provenance": "fetched-vdm1",
      "family": "skill_geometry",
      "id": 92,
      "kit_id": "poe1-caustic-arrow",
      "payload_json": {
        "geometry": "Projectile bow shot; on ground impact (or enemy impact), deploys a large caustic ground cloud. Ground cloud is the primary damage zone — large area-of-effect pool at landing site. Player does not scale hit/crit; scales chaos damage and DoT multiplier instead. Volley Support adds overlapping caustic clouds in a fan pattern."
      },
      "source_url": "https://www.poe-vault.com/guides/caustic-arrow-occultist-build-guide"
    },
    {
      "abstained": 0,
      "anchor_quote": "A fire and forget playstyle — deploy Wither totems, cast curses, and shoot arrows while focusing on dodging mechanics.",
