      "created_date": "2026-07-18",
      "extraction_provenance": "fetched-vdm1",
      "family": "skill_loop",
      "id": 91,
      "kit_id": "poe1-caustic-arrow",
      "payload_json": {
        "loop": "Fire Caustic Arrow at enemy or ground; on impact the arrow leaves a caustic ground cloud that ticks chaos DoT to enemies standing within it. Player kites enemies through the cloud. Deploy Wither totems for additional chaos damage amplification. Cast curses (Temporal Chains, Despair) while maintaining separation. Build does not require hitting the enemy directly — cloud damage is independent of hit/accuracy."
      },
      "source_url": "https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/2974902"
